<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 11.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 11.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- The new planned freedom monument in Tallinn is not popular as few donations have been received.</p>
<p>- The island of Saaremaa is seeing a booming tourist trade this summer.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
